                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having freckles; covered with freckles."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "497969bb-65c2-4a9f-8f35-1e4c13322eba",
                                                "sense_id": "24f2d0e1-90ad-398b-8b55-dd4a048ac831",
                                                "text": "A smile grew across Jim's freckled face."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "65781195-9b23-49d8-a9b7-5925f671647c",
                                                "sense_id": "24f2d0e1-90ad-398b-8b55-dd4a048ac831",
                                                "text": "Pro. […]Then was this Iſland / (Saue for the Son, that he^([sic]) did littour heere, / A frekelld whelpe, hag-borne) not honour'd with / A humane ſhape."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "07287dba-fd5c-45d9-b49e-ea23e3f90cd7",
                                                "sense_id": "24f2d0e1-90ad-398b-8b55-dd4a048ac831",
                                                "text": "At any other time Jessamy would have laughed at the expressions that chased each other over his freckled face: crossness left over from his struggle with the baby; incredulity; distress; and finally delight."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
